{title: Holy, Holy, Holy}
{artist: Gary Oliver}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Holy, Holy, Holy,
[D]Holy, Holy, Holy,
[D]Holy [A]is [G]the [D]Lord God [A]Almighty
[D]Worthy to receive glory,
[D]Worthy to receive honor,
[D]Worthy [A]to [G]re [D]ceive all our praises today

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Praise [G]Him, [C]Praise Him and [G]lift [D]Him up
[C]Praise [G]Him, [C]exhalt His [G]name [D]forever
[C]Praise [G]Him, [C]Praise Him and [C]lift [D]Him up
